  "ruleText": "Puc 3001.03 Waiver of Rules. The commission shall consider and determine any request for a waiver from the provisions of these rules pursuant to Puc 203.01.\n\nSource. #14613, eff 6-5-26, EXPIRES: 6-5-36",
